<title>SWEDEN: Kinnevik says sees higher pulp prices Q2.</title>
<headline>Kinnevik says sees higher pulp prices Q2.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish media and investment group Industriforvaltnings AB Kinnevik said on Tuesday falling pulp inventories could give scope for price increases on pulp in the second quarter.</p>
